# Presentation art and audio are kept locally and synchronized through external asset storage.
# These are the only local-media directories; keep source, creator, license, attribution, and
# modification records in tracked docs outside them. The concept-art reference and future root
# `screenshots/` images remain tracked because they are outside these paths.
/assets/
/art/
/audio/
/crates/*/assets/
/crates/*/art/
/crates/*/audio/
